      "source_xml_line": 809,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_31",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Hello. Wolf has already sent word of you. You got any questions?",
      "JA_current": "来たか。ウルフから話は聞いてるぞ。何か聞いておきたいことはあるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "31",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_41#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 827,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_41",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "We went hunting and hunt we did. I bet Wolf will be pleased.",
      "JA_current": "いい狩りだったな、きっちり仕留めてやったぜ。ウルフも喜ぶはずだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "41",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_51#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 830,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_51",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "There's more of 'em! Find the bastards and take them down!",
      "JA_current": "まだ残りがいるぞ！ クソどもを見つけ出して仕留めろ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "51",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_61#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 833,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_61",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Whoa, man! Now that was something! You wiped them out and left nothing for us. I'd never believe it if I hadn't seen it with my own eyes! That blew me away, man...",
      "JA_current": "おいおい、たまげたぜ！ そりゃねえだろ！ 俺たちの出番を残さず、全部ひとりで片づけちまいやがった。この目で見てなきゃ信じられねえよ！ まったく度肝を抜かれたぜ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "61",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_71#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 836,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_71",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "So, where are the piles of all these enemies you killed? You talk the talk, but you don't walk the walk. Get lost!",
      "JA_current": "おい、お前が倒したっていう敵の死体の山はどこにあるんだ？ 口ばっかりで何ひとつやってねえじゃねえか。失せろ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "71",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_311#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 812,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_311",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yes. How many bandits in the camp?",
      "JA_current": "ああ。アジトにバンディットは何人いる？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "311",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_3111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 815,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_3111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Seven or eight people. Two by the gate, two more in the building to the right near the fire, and another two in the one to the left - that's where they're keeping Nimble. Someone usually hangs around the yard as well. That's  about it. Shall we say a prayer and go?",
      "JA_current": "七、八人ってところだ。門のところに二人、右の建物の焚き火の周りに二人、左の建物にもう二人――そこにニンブルが監禁されてる。あとは中庭をうろついてる奴が一人。これで全員だ。どうする、神に祈りを捧げてから突っ込むか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "3111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_31111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 818,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_31111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Let's go. Round up your men.",
      "JA_current": "行くぞ。仲間を集めてくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "31111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_31112#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 821,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_31112",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No. We'd make too much noise. I'll go on my own.",
      "JA_current": "いや、集団じゃ目立ちすぎる。俺一人で行く。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "31112",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_factory_assault_start_311121#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 824,
      "string_id": "escape_factory_assault_start_311121",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, do as you please. Here, take this PB. Might as well try to do it quietly. Shout if something is up... Good luck, Rambo wannabe!",
      "JA_current": "好きにしな。ほら、このPBを持っていけ。少しは音を立てずにやれるはずだ。ヤバくなったら叫べよ……くたばるなよ、ランボー気取り！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_factory_assault_start",
          "phrase_id": "311121",
